---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Cloudflare Pages serves this file with a real 404 status for any unknown path.
// Without it, Pages falls back to index.html and every missing URL answers 200.
const lang = 'en';
---

<Base
  lang={lang}
  title="Page not found · EmbeddedNote"
  description="This page does not exist. Start from the E-paper hub, the selection table, or the notes index."
>
  <section class="nf">
    <p class="eyebrow">EMBEDDEDNOTE · 404</p>
    <h1>Page not found</h1>
    <p class="nf-zh">页面不存在</p>
    <p class="nf-lede">
      The address you followed does not exist on this site. It may have been renamed when the
      site was restructured. Three places cover most of what people are looking for.
    </p>

    <ul class="nf-links">
      <li>
        <a href="/en/e-paper/">E-paper hub →</a>
        <span>Waveform, ghosting, partial refresh, panel selection and the glossary.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/en/e-paper/selection/">Panel selection table →</a>
        <span>40 E5, E6 and Kaleido 3 panels with active area, resolution and frame size.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/en/articles/">All articles →</a>
        <span>Every engineering note and project write-up, newest first.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/zh/">中文首页 →</a>
        <span>中文版的专题与文章。</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="nf-note">
      If you arrived from a link on another site, that link is probably out of date. The search box
      in the header, or <a href="/en/sitemap-index.xml">the sitemap</a>, will find the page by title.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .nf { width: min(100%, 760px); margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px) 0 clamp(60px, 8vw, 100px); }
  .nf h1 { font: 700 clamp(32px, 4.6vw, 52px)/1.1 Georgia, 'Noto Serif SC', serif; letter-spacing: -.03em; margin: 8px 0 4px; color: #17211e; }
  .nf-zh { font: 500 clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 28px)/1.3 'Noto Serif SC', Georgia, serif; color: #8a928b; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .nf-lede { color: #4d574f; font-size: clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 19px); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .nf-links { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ddd5c7; }
  .nf-links li { border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd5c7; padding: 16px 0; }
  .nf-links a { display: inline-block; color: #b94530; font: 700 17px/1.4 Georgia, serif; text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .nf-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .nf-links span { display: block; color: #5c665f; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .nf-note { margin: 26px 0 0; color: #6a736c; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .nf-note a { color: #b94530; }
</style>
